														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2446342">
									

<p>Hey, just some grammar/phrasing stuff.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-2306-1 will begin to run, regardless as to the operating system used by the computer</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Should be &quot;regardless of.&quot;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>the presence of a microphone and camera on the computer allows for instance to both hear and see its surroundings</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Should be &quot;allows for the instance&quot; or &quot;an instance.&quot;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>with SCP-2306-1 communicating via means available within the alternative mediums, including:</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This feels awkward and a little redundant. It would obviously be communicating via available means, since it can't communicate via unavailable means, and &quot;within the alternative mediums&quot; is something we can assume. I would suggest &quot;with SCP-2306 communicating through other means, including: [list].&quot;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Do you have question regarding my functions?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Should be &quot;questions&quot; or &quot;a question.&quot;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Dr. Bozkurt attempts at regaining operation of SCP-2306-1 fail.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Should be &quot;Dr. Bozkurt's attempts.&quot;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Attempts to find a human match for this identity, either living or dead are currently ongoing.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Needs another comma after &quot;dead.&quot;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>an individual playing fetch with a dog (Black Lab)</p>
</blockquote>
<p>&quot;Black Lab&quot; is informal; should probably write out &quot;Labrador.&quot;</p>
</div>
